    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "A special note is needed here: this was found to be consistent for a set of branes all grade restricted to one of the charge window types in Fig. 4. On the other hand, if a set of branes grade restricted to different window types were mixed together, so that the entire set was not grade restricted to the same charge window type, then the open Witten indices was found to be inconsistent. Thus it is believed that branes must be grade restricted in exactly the same way when computing the Witten index, despite multiple ways of charge restriction being valid for a single choice of theta-angle."
